# Zintus — environment configuration index
#
# This monorepo has no single root .env; each deployable has its own example.
# Copy the one you need to a local .env (all .env* files are gitignored).
#
#   Gateway (Bun self-host) .......... apps/gateway/.env.example
#   Web (Next.js) .................... apps/web/.env.example
#   Mobile (Expo) ................... apps/mobile/.env.example
#   Cloud relay (Cloudflare) ........ workers/relay/.env.example  (+ wrangler secrets)
#
# Secrets (provider API keys, GATEWAY_TOKEN, relay KEY_ENCRYPTION_SECRET,
# Stripe/Resend keys, etc.) must NEVER be committed. The CI `security` job runs
# gitleaks over history to catch accidental commits.
#
# Most-used gateway knobs (see apps/gateway/.env.example for the full list):
#   GATEWAY_TOKEN          bearer token; REQUIRED to bind to a public interface
#   GATEWAY_RATELIMIT_RPM  per-client request/min cap (set when network-exposed)
#   GATEWAY_CORS_ORIGIN    CORS allowlist for browser clients
#   SENTRY_DSN             optional error tracking
